'''METAL SLUG STRIKES!''' (強襲！メタルスラッグ, ''Kyōshū! Metarusuraggu'', '''Assault! Metal Slug''') is a [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event|Metal Slug Defense]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 13.1 Update]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features many enemies from the collab.

==Overview==
===About===
METAL SLUG STRIKES! contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''MISSION'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available).  Rewards for the first completion of a stage can include XP, [[Battle Items]] and [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[METAL SLUG STRIKES!/MISSION 1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*METAL SLUG STRIKES! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

